# Claude Code driving the cell over MCP (xetal-cell-mcp), given only the
# goal: the DIP in the vise, then a resistor lead within 0.1 mm of pin 3,
# still held. Its session as the server saved it (2026-11-24: 6 turns,
# 20 s, every command accepted). Recorded while a carried part could pass
# through the vise unchecked: its align now stops where the resistor's
# lead meets a vise jaw (fixed 2026-11-24); a new session replaces it.
reset circuit=demo
tool A tweezers
pick A U1 grasp=ends
place A U1 at=0,0,-32
vise close
release A U1
lift A mm=80
pick A R1 grasp=body
align A R1.1.tip to=U1.3.tip gap=0.05
